{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46217","headline":"陪冯使君游六首 游灵泉院 · 贯休","name":"陪冯使君游六首 游灵泉院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珂佩喧喧满路岐，乱泉声里扣禅扉。\n对花语合希夷境，坐石苔黏黻黼衣。\n鸟啄古杉云冉冉，风吹清磬露霏霏。\n惠岩亦有孤峯在，只恋繙经未得归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46217.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46217","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}